    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Cause isolated from the focused trace and repaired. Shops stayed healthy through overflow storage, custom crafting, settings, and collectible polling. The first destructive transition occurred immediately after `updateNewspaperVendorMarkers`: the valid general-store volume was replaced by invalid handles, its state began cycling, and the LOCKED bit appeared across shop families.\n\nThe newspaper marker updater had copied Rockstar's private newspaper-shop cache refresh and wrote `Global_1430252` from GameplayTweaks' main loop. It now counts the same 14 persisted newspaper records locally and performs no shop-cache write. The temporary stage gates are removed, and the normal full ASI is installed. Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#209 remains actionable until shops are confirmed after restart.",
